[38;5;252m[1m## Coverage[0m[0m
[0m[0m
Bottom-up: [38;5;10mdot_product[0m and [38;5;10mnormalize[0m are [38;5;10mstatic[0m, so they're exercised transitively through [38;5;10mspectral_contrast[0m, which is then exercised again through [38;5;10mmatch[0m. Both symbols are always called through [38;5;10mlibloading[0m on the two [38;5;10m.so[0m files, never directly, so the [38;5;10m#[no_mangle][0m wrappers are part of what's under test. Comparisons are on raw bits, so NaN payloads and signed zeros count as differences; [38;5;10mmatch[0m cases also assert neither implementation writes through its input pointers. Roughly 11,500 randomized cases oversample NaNs, infinities and subnormals, plus targeted cases for zero and infinite magnitudes, [38;5;10mfloat[0m-rounding of products, cancellation, non-positive lengths, and the threshold boundary. [38;5;10mnm -D[0m parity holds: both libraries export exactly [38;5;10mmatch[0m and [38;5;10mspectral_contrast[0m.[0m[0m
